<in-bse-shp:DisclosureOfNotesOnShareholdingPatternExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="MainI">1. Note for Table II: During the Quarter ended June 30, 2026, Twin Star Holdings Ltd (TSHL) (part of the Promoter and Promoter Group of Vedanta Limited) has sold 65,072,990 equity shares. Post this transaction, the holding of TSHL has been reduced from 40.02% to 38.35%. 
2. Note for Table III: 2,98,632 shares are under abeyance category, pending for allotment as they are subjudice and hence, does not form part of the listed share capital. 
3. Note for Table IV: As per Regulation 3(5) of the SEBI (Share based Employee Benefits and Sweat Equity) Regulations, 2021, the voting rights of Vedanta Limited ESOS Trust are reserved. 
4. Note for Table V: Vedanta Limited is a majority-owned and controlled subsidiary of Vedanta Resources Limited (VRL). Vedanta Incorporated ('Vedanta Inc.') (Erstwhile Volcan Investments Limited) and its subsidiary hold 100.0% of the share capital and 100.0% of the voting rights of VRL. Vedanta Inc. is a holding company, 100.0% beneficially owned and controlled by the Anil Agarwal Discretionary Trust (Trust). Conclave PTC Limited (Conclave) is the trustee of the Trust and the sole registered shareholder of Vedanta Inc. VRLs shares are beneficially owned by Vedanta Inc. which may be deemed to be beneficially owned by the Trust, of which Mr. Anil Agarwal is the protector and with effect from October 16, 2014, one of the beneficiaries.</in-bse-shp:DisclosureOfNotesOnShareholdingPatternExplanatoryTextBlock>
